{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜新皇崗口岸擠塞問題(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-27-12-54-41CCuc2h0m.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：新皇崗口岸擠塞問題</p><p>剛過去的周末大型活動結束後，新皇崗口岸凌晨一度出現交通擠塞，原因是甚麼？未來如何更有效疏導車流？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>立法會議員(新界北)姚銘</p><p>香港汽車會永遠榮譽會長李耀培</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:01.875028+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T01:18:15.241874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:18:23.302889+00:00","content_hash":"a6421b9d90e586949ef2c3127285dcb3f4daddf8802278bf493cb6f64ec7429a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T06:22:01.875028+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}